## Setting no proxy

{{ provisioner_name }} runs its own internal proxy for services which may not
interact well if you run another httpd server. Here we set the no proxy variable
to prevent lookups.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment OpenCHAMI No Proxy Settings -->
```bash
export additonal_no_proxy="${sms_name},smd,smd-init,boot-service,\
metadata-service,tokensmith,acme-deploy,acme-register,haproxy,postgres,\
step-ca,coresmd-coredhcp,coresmd-coredns"
if [ -z "$no_proxy" ]; then
    export no_proxy="$additonal_no_proxy"
else
    export no_proxy="$no_proxy,$additonal_no_proxy"
fi
if [ -z "$NO_PROXY" ]; then
    export NO_PROXY="$additonal_no_proxy"
else
    export NO_PROXY="$NO_PROXY,$additonal_no_proxy"
fi
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
